                            <comment id="17343229" author="reamer" created="Wed, 12 May 2021 12:52:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Closed with &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4109&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/4109&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17620858" author="pduroux" created="Thu, 20 Oct 2022 07:38:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;br/&gt;
Is this supposed to be closed by 0.10.1? Because this always happens for us with version 0.10.1.&lt;br/&gt;
Thanks, Patrice&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17622160" author="reamer" created="Fri, 21 Oct 2022 09:50:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I also saw the problem again and I think my PR did not fix the problem.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17622169" author="reamer" created="Fri, 21 Oct 2022 10:00:33 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The main problem is that `sharedServiceLocator.shutdown();` is not called when shutting down the Zeppelin server.&lt;br/&gt;
This method call can create side effects that I am not aware of.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
